✔ the planner call: 800 ms timeout, any failure is no plan (the card never waits on it), bad answers are no plan (91.0441ms)
✔ generateArtifact plans once per card with the flag on, and runs as today when the planner fails (203.4477ms)
✔ planner timeout is 1.2 s and a timeout is logged as one (32.1151ms)
✔ a physical subject planned as a diagram gets its picture: picture + diagram, or the picture alone for a figure kind (0.7555ms)
✔ narrow second visual (owner 2026-11-08): two separate structures or organisms (secondVisual >= 0.7) get one visual each; below 0.7, and a planned picture + diagram, are unchanged (0.9398ms)
✔ GEN-1 G6: the planner gets the typed route's context as before, and null when the caller sets planContext: null (the roadmap: title and goal only, no document text to the third party) (189.5558ms)
✔ the bench card: "0.5 x 0.8 + 0.5 x (-0.5) = 0.34" computes to 0.15 and fails with explanation_bad_numbers naming the computed number (9.5672ms)
✔ equations that are right, rounded, or not a plain recompute are never flagged (1.4264ms)
✔ tolerance is one full unit of the written decimals when the computed value has more digits (a truncated result passes), half a unit when it fits exactly (0.7841ms)
✔ a wrong equation in plain text and in a chain is found; each distinct equation once; the 154 cards stay clean (0.8111ms)
✔ bars called a distribution must sum to 1 within half a unit per value; the bench softmax card (0.63, 0.23, 0.09) fails (111.4889ms)
✔ bars with no distribution wording, a per-bar rate, per-head weights, counts or a stacked chart are never flagged (0.585ms)
✔ a grouped chart: each series called a distribution sums to 1; the first failing series is named (0.5794ms)
✔ end to end: a wrong prose equation is repaired once with the rewrite sentence, then the step fails; nothing is delivered with the wrong number (741.9393ms)
✔ a card with a wrong box-plot diagram and a wrong prose equation names both in one problem (the diagram first) (6.9992ms)
